#, draft
msgid ""
"Your details and your career in one JSON file: to keep, to read, or to hand to another Postulo. Nothing about where you applied is in it."
msgstr ""
"Id-dettalji tiegħek u l-karriera tiegħek f'fajl JSON wieħed: biex iżżommu, taqrah, jew tagħtih lil Postulo ieħor. Xejn dwar fejn applikajt mhu fih."

#: src/postulo/documents/forms.py:114
#, draft
msgid "Your details give none yet, so nothing is printed until they do."
msgstr ""
"Id-dettalji tiegħek għadhom ma jagħtu l-ebda waħda, għalhekk xejn ma jiġi stampat sakemm jagħtu."

#: src/postulo/accounts/views.py:268
#, draft
msgid "Your details have been saved."
msgstr "Id-dettalji tiegħek ġew issejvjati."

#: src/postulo/templates/help/your_name.html:5
#, draft
msgid ""
"Your first and last name are the name your CVs and letters print at their top. <em>Form of address</em> and <em>Pronouns</em> are optional."
msgstr ""
"L-ewwel isem u l-kunjom tiegħek huma l-isem li s-CVs u l-ittri tiegħek jistampaw fuq nett. <em>Forma ta' indirizzar</em> u <em>Pronomi</em> huma fakultattivi."

