#, draft
msgid "Your name for it: “Telegram”, “Paperless at home”."
msgstr "Ismek għaliha: “Telegram”, “Paperless id-dar”."

#: src/postulo/templates/documents/cv_form.html:42
#, python-format, draft
msgid ""
"Your name, and under it what is chosen here from <a href=\"%(details_url)s\" class=\"underline\">Your details</a>, read again every time the document is drawn. Until you choose, that is your primary number, your account's address, the primary link of each kind, every identifier and where you are."
msgstr ""
"Ismek, u taħtu dak magħżul hawnhekk minn <a href=\"%(details_url)s\" class=\"underline\">Id-dettalji tiegħek</a>, moqri mill-ġdid kull darba li d-dokument jitfassal. Sakemm tagħżel, dan huwa n-numru primarju tiegħek, l-indirizz tal-kont tiegħek, il-link primarju ta' kull tip, kull identifikatur u fejn int."

#: src/postulo/documents/models.py:526
#, draft
msgid "Your own name"
msgstr "Ismek stess"

#: src/postulo/core/web_links.py:129
#, draft
msgid "Your own site, if you have one."
msgstr "Is-sit tiegħek stess, jekk għandek wieħed."

#: src/postulo/applications/forms.py:55
#, draft
msgid "Your own words for grouping applications. New ones go in the box below."
msgstr ""
"Il-kliem tiegħek stess biex tiggruppa applikazzjonijiet. Dawk ġodda jmorru fil-kaxxa hawn taħt."

#: src/postulo/accounts/views.py:619
#, draft
msgid "Your password is set. Sign in with it."
msgstr "Il-password tiegħek hija ssettjata. Idħol biha."

#: src/postulo/accounts/views.py:190 src/postulo/core/help.py:78
#: src/postulo/templates/accounts/profile.html:66
#, draft
msgid "Your picture"
msgstr "L-istampa tiegħek"

#: src/postulo/templates/resume/candidate_file.html:40
#, draft
msgid ""
"Your picture is left out. A JSON file cannot carry one, and leaving it out keeps this a file you can open and read in a text editor."
msgstr ""
"L-istampa tiegħek titħalla barra. Fajl JSON ma jistax iġorr waħda, u t-tluq tagħha jżomm dan fajl li tista' tiftaħ u taqra f'editur tat-test."

#: src/postulo/templates/help/your_picture.html:8
#, draft
msgid ""
"Your picture is shown at the top of every page, where it is the button that opens your menu, and to the administrators of this instance in their list of people. No CV and no letter prints it. Until you give Postulo a picture, it shows your initials."
msgstr ""
"L-istampa tiegħek tintwera fuq nett ta' kull paġna, fejn hija l-buttuna li tiftaħ il-menu tiegħek, u lill-amministraturi ta' din l-istanza fil-lista tagħhom tan-nies. L-ebda CV u l-ebda ittra ma jistampawha. Sakemm tagħti stampa lil Postulo, juri l-inizjali tiegħek."

#: src/postulo/documents/printing.py:137
