#: src/postulo/templates/help/contact_block.html:36
#, draft
msgid ""
"Your telephone numbers and your links have cards of their own further down. Where keeping several of one sort is switched off for you, this card has a single box for that sort instead. It holds the primary one: what you type there replaces it, and emptying the box removes it. The others recorded before are kept and not shown, and come back untouched if it is switched on again."
msgstr ""
"In-numri tat-telefon u l-links tiegħek għandhom karti tagħhom iktar 'l isfel. Fejn iż-żamma ta' diversi minn tip waħda hija mitfija għalik, din il-karta għandha kaxxa waħda għal dak it-tip minflok. Iżżomm il-primarju: dak li tittajpja hemm jissostitwih, u l-ħlas tal-kaxxa jneħħih. L-oħrajn irreġistrati qabel jinżammu u ma jintwerewx, u jiġu lura intatti jekk terġa' tixgħel."

